      "writtenOn": "2023-10-09T23:53:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is \"since boot\" correct?  Let\u0027s say the user authenticates with LSKF or biometric, then changes their lock screen to swipe.  Without rebooting, will `getLastAuthenticationTime()` return a nonzero value?  Or does the user having no available authentication methods anymore take precedence?",
